Write markdown in ~/blog and it becomes a blog, on the web, on gemini
and on gopher at once:

  https://runv.club/~you/blog/
  gemini://runv.club/~you/blog/
  gopher://runv.club/1/~you/blog

From your own machine:  scp post.md runv.club:blog/
On the server:          blog new my-first-post

The server rebuilds within 3 minutes, or run `blog build` to see it now.
A post can start with a small header, all optional:

  ---
  title: My first post
  date: 2026-10-25
  draft: true
  ---

Without a title, the first "# heading" is used. Drafts aren't published.
Your posts also show up on https://runv.club/planet/ and the home page.
